* ============================================================
* X64_SMARTBROWSE_MANUAL_CANARY.DTS
*
* Purpose:
*   Manual SMARTBROWSE probe. SMARTBROWSE is pager/interactive.
*
* Instruction:
*   When SMARTBROWSE prints its "-- More --" prompt, enter:
*
*     Q
*
* Expected:
*   It should show authoritative column names and values, then quit.
*   It should not mutate data.
* ============================================================

SET ECHO OFF
ECHO ===== X64 SMARTBROWSE MANUAL CANARY START =====

DO X64
ERASE VECSMBROW CONFIRM

CREATE X64 VECSMBROW (ABCDEFGHIJK C(10), ABCDEFGHIJL C(10), ABCDEFGHIJM C(10), NORMAL C(10))
APPEND
REPLACE ABCDEFGHIJK WITH "ONE"
REPLACE ABCDEFGHIJL WITH "TWO"
REPLACE ABCDEFGHIJM WITH "THREE"
REPLACE NORMAL WITH "OK"

ECHO ===== SMARTBROWSE MANUAL: TYPE Q AT PROMPT =====
SMARTBROWSE * PAGESIZE 5

ECHO ===== VERIFY TABLE STILL OPEN AND DATA INTACT =====
TUPLE ABCDEFGHIJK,ABCDEFGHIJL,ABCDEFGHIJM,NORMAL
TUPLE ABCDEFGHIJ,ABCDEFGH~1,ABCDEFGH~2,NORMAL

ECHO ===== CLEANUP =====
CLOSE
ERASE VECSMBROW CONFIRM

ECHO ===== X64 SMARTBROWSE MANUAL CANARY END =====
